    "created_at": "2022-09-26T08:25:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-26T08:25:48Z",
    "body": "Well, B was ultimately responsible for the request so C might want to be aware of that as it could have resulted in some side effects that are also reflected in the timing data. I don't think timing is uniquely different from other sorts of data in this respect.",
